# Questionnaire Design

## Section A: Demographics

* Age
* Gender
* Year of study
* CGPA/Academic grade
* Previous exposure to AI tools

## Section B: AI Usage Pattern

**Likert Scale (1–5)**

* I use AI tools regularly for studying.
* AI helps me understand difficult concepts.
* AI improves note preparation.
* AI assists in examination preparation.
* AI improves visual learning.

## Section C: Clinical Learning

* AI helps me understand diagnosis.
* AI improves treatment planning concepts.
* AI helps visualize clinical procedures.
* AI improves interpretation of radiographs.

## Section D: Faculty Support

* AI-generated diagrams improve teaching.
* AI-generated examples enhance understanding.
* Faculty should integrate AI into teaching.

## Section E: Concerns

* AI may provide inaccurate information.
* Over-reliance may reduce critical thinking.
* Ethical concerns exist regarding AI use.

## Section F: Overall Impact

* AI improves my learning efficiency.
* AI saves study time.
* AI increases confidence in learning.
* I would recommend AI use to peers.
